  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/403\",\n                \"diff_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/403.diff\",\n                \"patch_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/403.patch\",\n                \"merged_at\": \"2026-02-19T04:12:17Z\"\n              },\n              \"body\": \"fixes: https://github.com/entireio/cli/issues/402\",\n              \"reactions\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/403/reactions\",\n                \"total_count\": 0,\n                \"+1\": 0,\n                \"-1\": 0,\n                \"laugh\": 0,\n                \"hooray\": 0,\n                \"confused\": 0,\n                \"heart\": 0,\n                \"rocket\": 0,\n                \"eyes\": 0\n              },\n              \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/403/timeline\",\n              \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n              \"state_reason\": null,\n              \"score\": 1\n            },\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/509\",\n              \"repository_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli\",\n              \"labels_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/509/labels{/name}\",\n              \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/509/comments\",\n              \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/509/events\",\n              \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/509\",\n              \"id\": 3992968683,\n              \"node_id\": \"PR_kwDOQyo98M7GaQV_\",\n              \"number\": 509,\n              \"title\": \"Unify CalculateTokenUsage\",\n              \"user\": {\n                \"login\": \"gtrrz-victor\",\n                \"id\": 881031,\n                \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MTAzMQ==\",\n                \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/881031?v=4\",\n                \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/gtrrz-victor\",\n                \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/followers\",\n                \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/following{/other_user}\",\n                \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/gists{/gist_id}\",\n                \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n                \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/subscriptions\",\n                \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/orgs\",\n                \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/repos\",\n                \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/events{/privacy}\",\n                \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/gtrrz-victor/received_events\",\n                \"type\": \"User\",\n                \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n                \"site_admin\": false\n              },\n              \"labels\": [],\n              \"state\": \"closed\",\n              \"locked\": false,\n              \"assignees\": [],\n              \"milestone\": null,\n              \"comments\": 1,\n              \"created_at\": \"2026-02-26T03:00:18Z\",\n              \"updated_at\": \"2026-02-26T09:48:26Z\",\n              \"closed_at\": \"2026-02-26T09:48:24Z\",\n              \"assignee\": null,\n              \"author_association\": \"CONTRIBUTOR\",\n              \"issue_field_values\": [],\n              \"type\": null,\n              \"active_lock_reason\": null,\n              \"draft\": false,\n              \"pull_request\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/pulls/509\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/509\",\n                \"diff_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/509.diff\",\n                \"patch_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/509.patch\",\n                \"merged_at\": \"2026-02-26T09:48:24Z\"\n              },\n              \"body\": \"## Summary\\n- Delete duplicated token usage calculation logic that was scattered across condensation, lifecycle, and hook code\\n- Centralize agent dispatch into a single `agent.CalculateTokenUsage()` function\\n- Agent token calculators now accept `[]byte` instead of file paths, letting callers own the file I/O\\n\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\n              \"reactions\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/509/reactions\",\n                \"total_count\": 0,\n                \"+1\": 0,\n                \"-1\": 0,\n                \"laugh\": 0,\n                \"hooray\": 0,\n                \"confused\": 0,\n                \"heart\": 0,\n                \"rocket\": 0,\n                \"eyes\": 0\n              },\n              \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/509/timeline\",\n              \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n              \"state_reason\": null,\n              \"score\": 1\n            },\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/141\",\n              \"repository_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli\",\n              \"labels_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/141/labels{/name}\",\n              \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/141/comments\",\n              \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/141/events\",\n              \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/141\",\n              \"id\": 3893891914,\n              \"node_id\": \"PR_kwDOQyo98M7BVHNw\",\n              \"number\": 141,\n              \"title\": \"perf: optimize stop hook performance\",\n              \"user\": {\n                \"login\": \"khaong\",\n                \"id\": 351934,\n                \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTkzNA==\",\n                \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/351934?v=4\",\n                \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/khaong\",\n                \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/followers\",\n                \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/following{/other_user}\",\n                \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/gists{/gist_id}\",\n                \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n                \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/subscriptions\",\n                \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/orgs\",\n                \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/repos\",\n                \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/events{/privacy}\",\n                \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/received_events\",\n                \"type\": \"User\",\n                \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n                \"site_admin\": false\n              },\n              \"labels\": [],\n              \"state\": \"closed\",\n              \"locked\": false,\n              \"assignees\": [],\n              \"milestone\": null,\n              \"comments\": 0,\n              \"created_at\": \"2026-02-04T00:32:48Z\",\n              \"updated_at\": \"2026-02-05T05:01:10Z\",\n              \"closed_at\": \"2026-02-05T05:01:08Z\",\n              \"assignee\": null,\n              \"author_association\": \"CONTRIBUTOR\",\n              \"issue_field_values\": [],\n              \"type\": null,\n              \"active_lock_reason\": null,\n              \"draft\": false,\n              \"pull_request\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/pulls/141\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/141\",\n                \"diff_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/141.diff\",\n                \"patch_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/141.patch\",\n                \"merged_at\": \"2026-02-05T05:01:08Z\"\n              },\n              \"body\": \"## Summary\\n\\n- Consolidate redundant git status calls into single `ComputeFileChanges` function\\n- Eliminate double transcript parsing in `CalculateTotalTokenUsage`\\n\\n## Performance Improvement\\n\\n| Optimization | Savings |\\n|-------------|---------|\\n| Git status consolidation | ~40-80ms |\\n| Transcript parsing | ~0.3-0.6ms |\\n| **Total** | **~40-80ms** |\\n\\nMeasured in repos with 400+ files. The main win comes from calling `worktree.Status()` once instead of twice.\\n\\n## Test plan\\n\\n- [x] All unit tests pass\\n- [x] All integration tests pass\\n- [x] Linting clean\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n---\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Medium Risk**\\n> Touches checkpoint tree construction and file-change detection around session start, which can affect what gets committed (especially deletions/renames/ignored files); behavior is covered by added tests but relies on invoking the `git` CLI and parsing porcelain output.\\n> \\n> **Overview**\\n> Reduces stop-hook overhead by consolidating *new* and *deleted* file detection into a single `ComputeFileChanges` call, updating Claude Code and Gemini hook handlers (and `debug auto-commit`) to use it while deprecating the old split helpers.\\n> \\n> Optimizes temporary checkpoint creation for the *first* checkpoint by replacing a full working-directory walk with a `git status --porcelain -z -uall` based collector that respects repo + global gitignore, and by merging user pre-existing deletions into the checkpoint tree; adds extensive tests covering first-checkpoint capture of modified tracked files, untracked files, gitignored exclusions, deletions, renames, and filenames with spaces.\\n> \\n> Avoids double transcript parsing in Claude Code token accounting by parsing once and reusing the parsed transcript for both token usage and spawned subagent detection (including handling empty transcript paths).\\n> \\n> <sup>Written by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot) for commit 941f75974d8415c98bab8f55655262928685af2f. This will update automatically on new commits. Configure [here](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\",\n              \"reactions\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/141/reactions\",\n                \"total_count\": 0,\n                \"+1\": 0,\n                \"-1\": 0,\n                \"laugh\": 0,\n                \"hooray\": 0,\n                \"confused\": 0,\n                \"heart\": 0,\n                \"rocket\": 0,\n                \"eyes\": 0\n              },\n              \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/141/timeline\",\n              \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n              \"state_reason\": null,\n              \"score\": 1\n            },\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/168\",\n              \"repository_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli\",\n              \"labels_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/168/labels{/name}\",\n              \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/168/comments\",\n              \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/168/events\",\n              \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/168\",\n              \"id\": 3908903370,\n              \"node_id\": \"PR_kwDOQyo98M7CG3cO\",\n              \"number\": 168,\n              \"title\": \"Add pure session phase state machine (ENT-221)\",\n              \"user\": {\n                \"login\": \"khaong\",\n                \"id\": 351934,\n                \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTkzNA==\",\n                \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/351934?v=4\",\n                \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/khaong\",\n                \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/followers\",\n                \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/following{/other_user}\",\n                \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/gists{/gist_id}\",\n                \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n                \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/subscriptions\",\n                \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/orgs\",\n                \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/repos\",\n                \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/events{/privacy}\",\n                \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/received_events\",\n                \"type\": \"User\",\n                \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n                \"site_admin\": false\n              },\n              \"labels\": [],\n              \"state\": \"closed\",\n              \"locked\": false,\n              \"assignees\": [],\n              \"milestone\": null,\n              \"comments\": 0,\n              \"created_at\": \"2026-02-07T00:09:28Z\",\n              \"updated_at\": \"2026-02-09T04:43:01Z\",\n              \"closed_at\": \"2026-02-09T04:42:57Z\",\n              \"assignee\": null,\n              \"author_association\": \"CONTRIBUTOR\",\n              \"issue_field_values\": [],\n              \"type\": null,\n              \"active_lock_reason\": null,\n              \"draft\": false,\n              \"pull_request\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/pulls/168\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/168\",\n                \"diff_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/168.diff\",\n                \"patch_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/168.patch\",\n                \"merged_at\": \"2026-02-09T04:42:57Z\"\n              },\n              \"body\": \"## Summary\\n- Adds a standalone, pure-function state machine for session lifecycle phases (`session/phase.go`)\\n- Defines 4 phases (IDLE, ACTIVE, ACTIVE_COMMITTED, ENDED) and 5 events with action-producing transitions\\n- Includes comprehensive table-driven tests and Mermaid diagram generation\\n- No behavioral changes — this is the foundation for wiring phase tracking into hooks (follow-up PR)\\n\\n## Design\\n- `Transition(phase, event, ctx) → TransitionResult{NewPhase, Actions}` — pure function, no side effects\\n- Actions are declarative (e.g., `ActionCondense`, `ActionMigrateShadowBranch`) — callers decide how to execute\\n- Backward compatible: empty/unknown phase treated as IDLE\\n- Rebase-in-progress always produces empty actions (no-op)\\n\\n## Test plan\\n- [x] All phase/event combinations covered in table-driven tests\\n- [x] Backward compat tests (empty phase → IDLE)\\n- [x] Rebase guard tested across all phases\\n- [x] `go build ./...`, `mise run lint`, `mise run test:ci` all pass\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\n\\n## PR Stack (ENT-221)\\n> **1 of 5 (1A)** ← you are here\\n> 1. #168 — Pure session phase state machine\\n> 2. #169 — Consolidate session state types + transcript simplification\\n> 3. #170 — Wire state machine into hooks\\n> 4. #172 — Phase-aware PostCommit + PrepareCommitMsg amend fix\\n> 5. #174 — Cleanup: session helpers, transition logging, Gemini parity\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n---\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Low Risk**\\n> Adds new, self-contained session phase logic plus tests and documentation generation without wiring it into runtime hooks, so existing behavior should be unaffected aside from new dependencies and build/test surface area.\\n> \\n> **Overview**\\n> Introduces a **pure-function session lifecycle phase state machine** (`cmd/entire/cli/session/phase.go`) with 4 phases and event-driven transitions that return a next phase plus declarative `Action`s (e.g., condense, migrate shadow branch, stale-session warning), including backward-compatible handling of unknown/empty phases and a rebase no-op guard.\\n> \\n> Adds comprehensive table-driven tests for phase parsing, transition coverage, backward-compat cases, and Mermaid diagram output, plus a `go generate` helper (`gen_state_diagram.go`) that writes a generated `.mmd` diagram under `docs/generated/` (with that directory ignored except for `.gitignore`). Updates `go.mod` to include `github.com/stretchr/testify` for the new tests.\\n> \\n> <sup>Written by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot) for commit 9ec7bda1863f69e47f99e7cf127a5f4e53e0efee. This will update automatically on new commits. Configure [here](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\",\n              \"reactions\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/168/reactions\",\n                \"total_count\": 0,\n                \"+1\": 0,\n                \"-1\": 0,\n                \"laugh\": 0,\n                \"hooray\": 0,\n                \"confused\": 0,\n                \"heart\": 0,\n                \"rocket\": 0,\n                \"eyes\": 0\n              },\n              \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/168/timeline\",\n              \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n              \"state_reason\": null,\n              \"score\": 1\n            },\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/143\",\n              \"repository_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli\",\n              \"labels_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/143/labels{/name}\",\n              \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/143/comments\",\n              \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/143/events\",\n              \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/143\",\n              \"id\": 3894560823,\n              \"node_id\": \"PR_kwDOQyo98M7BXT1u\",\n              \"number\": 143,\n              \"title\": \"perf: use git CLI instead of filesystem walk for first checkpoint\",\n              \"user\": {\n                \"login\": \"khaong\",\n                \"id\": 351934,\n                \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTkzNA==\",\n                \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/351934?v=4\",\n                \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/khaong\",\n                \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/followers\",\n                \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/following{/other_user}\",\n                \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/gists{/gist_id}\",\n                \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n                \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/subscriptions\",\n                \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/orgs\",\n                \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/repos\",\n                \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/events{/privacy}\",\n                \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/khaong/received_events\",\n                \"type\": \"User\",\n                \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n                \"site_admin\": false\n              },\n              \"labels\": [],\n              \"state\": \"closed\",\n              \"locked\": false,\n              \"assignees\": [],\n              \"milestone\": null,\n              \"comments\": 3,\n              \"created_at\": \"2026-02-04T04:37:10Z\",\n              \"updated_at\": \"2026-02-05T04:28:01Z\",\n              \"closed_at\": \"2026-02-05T04:27:58Z\",\n              \"assignee\": null,\n              \"author_association\": \"CONTRIBUTOR\",\n              \"issue_field_values\": [],\n              \"type\": null,\n              \"active_lock_reason\": null,\n              \"draft\": false,\n              \"pull_request\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/pulls/143\",\n                \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/143\",\n                \"diff_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/143.diff\",\n                \"patch_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/143.patch\",\n                \"merged_at\": \"2026-02-05T04:27:57Z\"\n              },\n              \"body\": \"## Summary\\n\\n- Replace `collectWorkingDirectoryFiles()` with `collectChangedFiles()` to fix slow shadow branch creation when `node_modules/` or `.worktrees/` exist\\n- The old implementation walked the entire filesystem, only skipping `.git/` and `.entire/` - extremely slow with large ignored directories\\n- The new implementation uses `git status --porcelain -z -uall` which:\\n  - Respects all `.gitignore` sources including global gitignore (`core.excludesfile`)\\n  - Uses NUL-separated output to correctly handle filenames with spaces/special chars\\n  - Handles all git status codes: modified (M), added (A), deleted (D), renamed (R), copied (C), type changes (T), unmerged (U)\\n  - Passes context from caller for cancellation/timeout support\\n\\n## Test plan\\n\\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_CapturesModifiedTrackedFiles`\\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_CapturesUntrackedFiles`  \\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_ExcludesGitIgnoredFiles`\\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_UserAndAgentChanges`\\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_CapturesUserDeletedFiles`\\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_CapturesRenamedFiles`\\n- [x] Added `TestWriteTemporary_FirstCheckpoint_FilenamesWithSpaces`\\n- [x] Verified in jaja-bot repo: new shadow commits exclude `node_modules/` and `dist/`\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n---\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Medium Risk**\\n> Changes the core file-selection logic for first checkpoints and introduces `git` CLI execution/parsing, which could alter what gets captured (especially around renames/deletes/ignored files) or behave differently across environments; extensive new tests reduce regression risk.\\n> \\n> **Overview**\\n> **First-checkpoint shadow commits are now built from `git status` output instead of a full filesystem walk.** `WriteTemporary` replaces `collectWorkingDirectoryFiles()` with `collectChangedFiles()` (via `git status --porcelain -z -uall`) to avoid scanning large ignored directories, correctly handle special filenames, and respect repo/global ignore rules; it also merges user-preexisting deletions into the checkpoint’s deletion set.\\n> \\n> **File-change computation is streamlined for hooks/debug output.** A new `ComputeFileChanges()` returns *new* and *deleted* files in one status call (marking `ComputeNewFiles`/`ComputeDeletedFiles` as deprecated), and both Claude/Gemini stop handlers plus `debug auto-commit` are updated to use it.\\n> \\n> **Minor perf/robustness tweaks.** Claude Code token usage now parses the transcript once in `CalculateTotalTokenUsage` and returns empty usage when no transcript path is provided, and the PR adds extensive tests covering first-checkpoint behavior (modified tracked files, untracked files, ignored files, deletions, renames, and filenames with spaces) plus `ComputeFileChanges`.\\n> \\n> <sup>Written by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot) for commit b8f686f12b7b4bf4b56b3eaaff84e5001dce8625. This will update automatically on new commits. Configure [here](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\",\n              \"reactions\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/143/reactions\",\n                \"total_count\": 0,\n                \"+1\": 0,\n                \"-1\": 0,\n                \"laugh\": 0,\n                \"hooray\": 0,\n                \"confused\": 0,\n                \"heart\": 0,\n                \"rocket\": 0,\n                \"eyes\": 0\n              },\n              \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/143/timeline\",\n              \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n              \"state_reason\": null,\n              \"score\": 1\n            },\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/694\",\n              \"repository_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli\",\n              \"labels_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/694/labels{/name}\",\n              \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/694/comments\",\n              \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/694/events\",\n              \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/694\",\n              \"id\": 4072733246,\n              \"node_id\": \"PR_kwDOQyo98M7KcqIj\",\n              \"number\": 694,\n              \"title\": \"chore(deps): bump jdx/mise-action from 3 to 4\",\n              \"user\": {\n