> \\n> The new section catalogs shipped work from linked PRs: CLI additions (`checkpoint list --outgoing`, enable privacy notice, repo sync/resync, redaction IP category and stats, Droid token usage, brain plugin install prompt), trail link/show and enable/review behavior changes, and fixes for subagent token rollup, worktree checkpoint attribution, doctor sweep branch handling, `git-remote-entire` protocol version, and OPF on CRLF transcripts. Housekeeping covers experimental command visibility by build type, transcript package export, telemetry, and test isolation.\\n> \\n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 130e542605869907a0ca14d5995965743931a643. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\",\n              \"reactions\": {\n                \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/2885/reactions\",\n                \"total_count\": 0,\n                \"+1\": 0,\n                \"-1\": 0,\n                \"laugh\": 0,\n                \"hooray\": 0,\n                \"confused\": 0,\n                \"heart\": 0,\n                \"rocket\": 0,\n                \"eyes\": 0\n              },\n              \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/2885/timeline\",\n              \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n              \"state_reason\": null,\n              \"score\": 1\n            },\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/2774\",\n              \"repository_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli\",\n              \"labels_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/2774/labels{/name}\",\n              \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/2774/comments\",\n              \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/cli/issues/2774/events\",\n              \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pu