s{/privacy}\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/evisdren/received_events\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n      \"site_admin\": false\n    },\n    \"comments\": 0,\n    \"review_comments\": 6,\n    \"maintainer_can_modify\": false,\n    \"commits\": 9,\n    \"additions\": 1679,\n    \"deletions\": 242,\n    \"changed_files\": 11\n  },\n  \"c\": {\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#discussion_r4305642750\",\n        \"body\": \"### Local facts evicted on first-writer collision\\n\\n**High Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\nThe keep filter inspects only the feed copy'\"'\"'s `TrailID`, `CreatedBy`, and anchors, then the removal pass drops any cache-known local row that is not kept and lacks a transcript path. A locally authored `remember` fact whose commit is reachable from `HEAD` is therefore evicted when a teammate independently filed the same `text`+`paths` first and that first-writer copy fails the filter. The transcript stand-down covers distill only; authored facts typically have session/commit anchors and are unprotected.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 6e1659dc-7267-4f4c-8ea1-b9756cd661d7 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L265-L271\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214\\ninternal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214)\\n- [`internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4305642750,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5561345670,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 295,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/hosted_sync.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Local facts evicted on first-writer collision</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>High Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">The keep filter inspects only the feed copy'\"'\"'s <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">TrailID</code>, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">CreatedBy</code>, and anchors, then the removal pass drops any cache-known local row that is not kept and lacks a transcript path. A locally authored <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">remember</code> fact whose commit is reachable from <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">HEAD</code> is therefore evicted when a teammate independently filed the same <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">text</code>+<code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">paths</code> first and that first-writer copy fails the filter. The transcript stand-down covers distill only; authored facts typically have session/commit anchors and are unprotected.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</details>\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d\\\"><tt>781685c</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#discussion_r4305642753\",\n        \"body\": \"### Marker written before pull succeeds\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`writeHostedFactsBinding` runs as soon as `pushHostedFacts` returns success, including the empty-store path that never contacts the server. A later pull failure still leaves the per-branch marker in place, so the blind-spot note stays silent on a checkout that never received the feed. The previous CAS `Sync` only recorded the marker after a completed two-sided exchange.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 3df8921f-b1fa-4bc1-a460-91ef2b1b9616 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L85-L99\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/puneetpalsingh/Documents/Code/OSSplayground/Entire/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 -c 'import sys;open(sys.argv[1],\"ab\").write(sys.argv[2].encode())' '/Users/puneetpalsingh/.codex/entire-20-audit-2026-11-16/public/entire-brain-403.json' 'entire-brain\",\n        \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain\",\n        \"archive_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-brain/{archive_format}{/ref}\",\n        \"assignees_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entir