en the removal pass drops any cache-known local row that is not kept and lacks a transcript path. A locally authored `remember` fact whose commit is reachable from `HEAD` is therefore evicted when a teammate independently filed the same `text`+`paths` first and that first-writer copy fails the filter. The transcript stand-down covers distill only; authored facts typically have session/commit anchors and are unprotected.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 6e1659dc-7267-4f4c-8ea1-b9756cd661d7 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L265-L271\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214\\ninternal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214)\\n- [`internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4305642750,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5561345670,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 295,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/hosted_sync.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Local facts evicted on first-writer collision</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>High Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">The keep filter inspects only the feed copy'\"'\"'s <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">TrailID</code>, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">CreatedBy</code>, and anchors, then the removal pass drops any cache-known local row that is not kept and lacks a transcript path. A locally authored <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">remember</code> fact whose commit is reachable from <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">HEAD</code> is therefore evicted when a teammate independently filed the same <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">text</code>+<code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">paths</code> first and that first-writer copy fails the filter. The transcript stand-down covers distill only; authored facts typically have session/commit anchors and are unprotected.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L210-L214</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/hosted_pull_filter.go#L68-L78</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</details>\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b