d-spot note stays silent on a checkout that never received the feed. The previous CAS `Sync` only recorded the marker after a completed two-sided exchange.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 3df8921f-b1fa-4bc1-a460-91ef2b1b9616 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L85-L99\\ninternal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":18250}},"started_at_ms":1794842131858,"completed_at_ms":1794842131860}}
