id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 90,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/hosted_sync.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Marker written before pull succeeds</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">writeHostedFactsBinding</code> runs as soon as <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">pushHostedFacts</code> returns success, including the empty-store path that never contacts the server. A later pull failure still leaves the per-branch marker in place, so the blind-spot note stays silent on a checkout that never received the feed. The previous CAS <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">Sync</code> only recorded the marker after a completed two-sided exchange.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/hosted_sync.go#L118-L122</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</details>\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d\\\"><tt>781685c</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#discussion_r4305642757\",\n        \"body\": \"### Missing records keep a stale cursor\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\nWhen `state.json` loads but `records.ndjson` is absent, `loadHostedFeedCache` returns the stored cursor with an empty item map. Pull then resumes from that cursor and never refetches earlier pages. Facts not already in the branch store are skipped permanently until a server 400 forces a cursor reset, which breaks the cache'\"'\"'s claimed rebuild-by-reset contract.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 836956df-e4bb-4be5-a86d-fb45d0150d27 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/hosted_feed_cache.go#L66-L70\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4305642757,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5561345670,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-18T03:59:23Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/hosted_feed_cache.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Missing records keep a stale cursor</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">When <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">state.json</code> loads but <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">records.ndjson</code> is absent, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">loadHostedFeedCache</code> returns the stored cursor with an empty item map. Pull then resumes from that cursor and never refetches earlier pages. Facts not already in the branch store are skipped permanently until a server 400 forces a cursor reset, which breaks the cache'\"'\"'s claimed rebuild-by-reset contract.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722