d by TestHostedSyncMarkerRequiresSuccessfulPull.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#pullrequestreview-5561415301\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"name\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256443556?u=db6e15770a2509911d4dfcbe8135d205d74825f1&v=4\",\n          \"id\": 256443556\n        },\n        \"id\": 5561415301,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T04:22:47Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#discussion_r4305706484\",\n        \"body\": \"Fixed in ae76950a: a state.json without its records.ndjson now loads as an empty cache, cursor included, so the next pull refetches from the start instead of resuming past unseen pages. Pinned by TestHostedFeedCacheMissingRecordsResetsCursor.\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"name\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256443556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 256443556\n        },\n        \"id\": 4305706484,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5561415333,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": 4305642757,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T04:22:48Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-18T04:22:48Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/hosted_feed_cache.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Fixed in <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/ae76950a8c6d38fff584a6b68e3d86c6660821c4/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/ae76950a8c6d38fff584a6b68e3d86c6660821c4\\\"><tt>ae76950</tt></a>: a state.json without its records.ndjson now loads as an empty cache, cursor included, so the next pull refetches from the start instead of resuming past unseen pages. Pinned by TestHostedFeedCacheMissingRecordsResetsCursor.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#pullrequestreview-5561415333\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"name\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256443556?u=db6e15770a2509911d4dfcbe8135d205d74825f1&v=4\",\n          \"id\": 256443556\n        },\n        \"id\": 5561415333,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-18T04:22:48Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403\",\n    \"title\": \"entireio/entire-brain PR #403 comments\",\n    \"display_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403\",\n    \"display_title\": \"entireio/entire-brain PR #403 comments\"\n  }\n}'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/puneetpalsingh/Documents/Code/OSSplayground/Entire/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 -c 'import sys;open(sys.argv[1],\"ab\").write(sys.argv[2].encode())' '/Users/puneetpalsingh/.codex/entire-20-audit-2026-11-16/public/entire-brain-403.json' 'height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></p>\\n\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>❌ Bugbot Autofix is OFF. To automatically fix reported issues with cloud agents, enable autofix in the <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor dashboard</a>.</sup></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><em>Comment <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">@cursor review</code> or <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">bugbot run</code> to trigger another review on this PR</em></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/781685cfa63f4e8dadac90e87962e365e423db6d\\\"><tt>781685c</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/403#discussion_r4305706400\",\n        \"body\": \"Fixed in ae76950a: the removal pass now also runs the keep filter over the local copy'\"'\"'s own anchors (judged memberless), so an authored fact with a locally reachable commit anchor — or an anchor-less pool fact — survives even when the teammate'\"'\"'s first-writer feed copy fails the filter. Pinned by TestPullRemovalSparesLocallyAnchoredAuthoredFacts.\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"name\": \"evisdren\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256443556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 256443556\n        },\n        \"id\": 4305706400,\n        \"pull_request_rev