l\": \"https://api.github.com/users/evisdren/subscriptions\",\n      \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/evisdren/orgs\",\n      \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/evisdren/repos\",\n      \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/evisdren/events{/privacy}\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/evisdren/received_events\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n      \"site_admin\": false\n    },\n    \"comments\": 0,\n    \"review_comments\": 4,\n    \"maintainer_can_modify\": false,\n    \"commits\": 4,\n    \"additions\": 744,\n    \"deletions\": 8723,\n    \"changed_files\": 64\n  },\n  \"c\": {\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/452#discussion_r4356173675\",\n        \"body\": \"### Skip path ignores JSON flag\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\nThe connected-repo `NO_EGRESS` skip writes a human sentence to stdout and returns success without consulting `syncOpts.jsonOut`. A `--json` invocation therefore exits 0 with prose on stdout instead of a JSON object, so machine callers cannot parse the result.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: ad15fa70-f866-4395-8832-364d1b0deadb -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/facts_sync_cmd.go#L127-L129\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit d2a89cd67f6d23b0a84830e5985944a4ee585d41. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4356173675,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5623995692,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-10-23T04:46:10Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-23T04:46:10Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/facts_sync_cmd.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Skip path ignores JSON flag</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">The connected-repo <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">NO_EGRESS</code> skip writes a human sentence to stdout and returns success without consulting <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">syncOpts.jsonOut</code>. A <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--json</code> invocation therefore exits 0 with prose on stdout instead of a JSON object, so machine callers cannot parse the result.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/d2a89cd67f6d23b0a84830e5985944a4ee585d41/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/d2a89cd67f6d23b0a84830e5985944a4ee585d41\\\"><tt>d2a89cd</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/452#discussion_r4356173687\",\n        \"body\": \"### Corrupt binding syncs stale git-meta\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\nWhen `readHostedRepoBinding` returns an error, plain `memories sync` warns and runs the local git-meta merge. That error means the binding file exists but is untrusted, so the repo is still connected or opted out. A keep-both merge against the stale local head re-raises deferred per-fact conflicts into the review queue.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 94335462-d761-454a-aee2-c28238de0f59 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/facts_sync_cmd.go#L113-L131\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit d2a89cd67f6d23b0a84830e5985944a4ee585d41. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4356173687,\n        \"pu'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/puneetpalsingh/Documents/Code/OSSplayground/Entire/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 -c 'import sys;open(sys.argv[1],\"ab\").write(sys.argv[2].encode())' '/Users/puneetpalsingh/.codex/entire-20-audit-2026-11-16/public/entire-brain-452.json' ': {\n          \"key\": \"mit\",\n          \"name\": \"MIT License\",\n          \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit\",\n          \"spdx_id\": \"MIT\",\n          \"node_id\": \"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz\"\n        },\n        \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-brain\",\n        \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain\",\n        \"archive_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-brain/{archive_format}{/ref}\",\n        \"assignees_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-brain/assignees{/user}\",\n        \"blobs_url\": \"https://api.github.com/re