 \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/subscriptions\",\n      \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/orgs\",\n      \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/repos\",\n      \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/events{/privacy}\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/received_events\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n      \"site_admin\": false\n    },\n    \"comments\": 0,\n    \"review_comments\": 4,\n    \"maintainer_can_modify\": false,\n    \"commits\": 4,\n    \"additions\": 550,\n    \"deletions\": 89,\n    \"changed_files\": 10\n  },\n  \"c\": {\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294#discussion_r4057332711\",\n        \"body\": \"### Graph build dies on one member\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`workspaceGraphGeneration` treats a single member `loadBrainManifest` failure as fatal, so `buildWorkspaceGraphPayload` and `loadWorkspaceGraphPayload` now abort the whole workspace graph. The same function still treats later member failures as per-repo errors, so one corrupt or newer-schema brain drops every healthy member'\"'\"'s edges and turns search'\"'\"'s graph group into an error.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: e14fe79b-036a-4c2c-b5cc-726a8d685e27 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/workspace.go#L3913-L3928\\ninternal/cli/workspace.go#L1046-L1050\\ninternal/cli/workspace.go#L2841-L2849\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/cli/workspace.go#L1046-L1050`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/internal/cli/workspace.go#L1046-L1050)\\n- [`internal/cli/workspace.go#L2841-L2849`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/internal/cli/workspace.go#L2841-L2849)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4057332711,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5260971378,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-20T15:45:23Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-20T15:45:23Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/workspace.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Graph build dies on one member</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">workspaceGraphGeneration</code> treats a single member <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">loadBrainManifest</code> failure as fatal, so <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">buildWorkspaceGraphPayload</code> and <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">loadWorkspaceGraphPayload</code> now abort the whole workspace graph. The same function still treats later member failures as per-repo errors, so one corrupt or newer-schema brain drops every healthy member'\"'\"'s edges and turns search'\"'\"'s graph group into an error.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/internal/cli/workspace.go#L1046-L1050\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/workspace.go#L1046-L1050</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/internal/cli/workspace.go#L2841-L2849\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/cli/workspace.go#L2841-L2849</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</details>\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57\\\"><tt>8922a65</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294#discussion_r4057332715\",\n        \"body\": \"### Duplicate route and channel edges\\n\\n**Low Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\nRoute-call and channel-flow builders dropped the `endpoint + caller/handler id` `seen` set and now rely on `keepWorkspaceGraphEdge`. That helper treats two pairs as the same only when `SharedCount` matches too, so the same canonical pair can be stored twice when one symbol is appended from multiple aggregates with different counts.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 9e19f738-0a0b-461b-9ae5-f835d99dc2a8 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/cli/workspace.go#L1539-L1562\\ninternal/cli/workspace.go#L1685-L1708\\ninternal/cli/workspace.go#L2350-L2363\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/cli/workspace.go#L1685-L1708`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/internal/cli/workspace.go#L1685-L1708)\\n- [`internal/cli/workspace.go#L2350-L2363`](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/blob/8922a654483309f6d60cf54e22d01b2cd0adae57/internal/cli/workspace.go#L2350-L2363)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\