l\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70720?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 70720\n        },\n        \"id\": 4057388597,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5261025722,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": 4057332711,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-20T16:12:07Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-20T16:12:07Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/workspace.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Fixed in <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/c7e9b9245962dff9526e8def19b0b7991204afa2/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/c7e9b9245962dff9526e8def19b0b7991204afa2\\\"><tt>c7e9b92</tt></a>. An unreadable member contributes an unavailable-state generation marker; healthy members still build and load partial graph results, and member recovery invalidates the cache. Regression covers two healthy members plus one damaged manifest, recovery, and stale cache rejection. Full Go suite, focused race tests and vet pass.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294#pullrequestreview-5261025722\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"ashtom\",\n          \"name\": \"ashtom\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70720?u=109e9a9ab13598cad80ac3b4b8bcaccdacbcd3df&v=4\",\n          \"id\": 70720\n        },\n        \"id\": 5261025722,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-20T16:12:07Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294#discussion_r4057388704\",\n        \"body\": \"Fixed in c7e9b924. Bounded selection deduplicates the logical endpoint/symbol pair independently of its rank, retaining its strongest candidate. Route/channel regressions include reversed score order and verify distinct pairs retain their slots. Full Go suite and race tests pass; the bounded allocation benchmark remains 123,456 bytes for 250k pairs with limit one.\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"ashtom\",\n          \"name\": \"ashtom\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70720?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 70720\n        },\n        \"id\": 4057388704,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5261025797,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": 4057332715,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-20T16:12:09Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-20T16:12:09Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 1553,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/cli/workspace.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Fixed in <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/c7e9b9245962dff9526e8def19b0b7991204afa2/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/c7e9b9245962dff9526e8def19b0b7991204afa2\\\"><tt>c7e9b92</tt></a>. Bounded selection deduplicates the logical endpoint/symbol pair independently of its rank, retaining its strongest candidate. Route/channel regressions include reversed score order and verify distinct pairs retain their slots. Full Go suite and race tests pass; the bounded allocation benchmark remains 123,456 bytes for 250k pairs with limit one.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294#pullrequestreview-5261025797\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\