card\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/commit/c7e9b9245962dff9526e8def19b0b7991204afa2\\\"><tt>c7e9b92</tt></a>. Bounded selection deduplicates the logical endpoint/symbol pair independently of its rank, retaining its strongest candidate. Route/channel regressions include reversed score order and verify distinct pairs retain their slots. Full Go suite and race tests pass; the bounded allocation benchmark remains 123,456 bytes for 250k pairs with limit one.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294#pullrequestreview-5261025797\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"ashtom\",\n          \"name\": \"ashtom\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70720?u=109e9a9ab13598cad80ac3b4b8bcaccdacbcd3df&v=4\",\n          \"id\": 70720\n        },\n        \"id\": 5261025797,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-20T16:12:09Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294\",\n    \"title\": \"entireio/entire-brain PR #294 comments\",\n    \"display_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/294\",\n    \"display_title\": \"entireio/entire-brain PR #294 comments\"\n  }\n}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":11542}},"started_at_ms":1794842133819,"completed_at_ms":1794842133819}}
