live resume marker for any out-of-scope absent branch. The target is expected to hold other namespaces'\"'\"' refs, so a scoped run can wipe another bootstrap'\"'\"'s ENT-2054 resume state and force a full re-import.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: d1c2de20-36d5-4a73-8008-a4d170c04a8d -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/planner/types.go#L151-L159\\ninternal/planner/planner.go#L391-L405\\ninternal/planner/include_test.go#L206-L237\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n\\n- [`internal/planner/planner.go#L391-L405`](https://github.com/entireio/git-sync/blob/ad05d03275134ef902cc921ae098477fea9e6d2e/internal/planner/planner.go#L391-L405)\\n- [`internal/planner/include_test.go#L206-L237`](https://github.com/entireio/git-sync/blob/ad05d03275134ef902cc921ae098477fea9e6d2e/internal/planner/include_test.go#L206-L237)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Triggered by learned rule: <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot/rules/learned/8c0a843c-1b56-4529-b1c4-36627a9217c6\\\">Live bootstrap resume marker lifecycle</a></sup>\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit ad05d03275134ef902cc921ae098477fea9e6d2e. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3992480315,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5182448833,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-11T18:59:28Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-11T18:59:28Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 171,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/planner/types.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Scoped prune drops other resume markers</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>High Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">InTargetScope</code> keeps every <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">refs/gitsync/</code> marker in prune scope under <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">IncludeRefPrefixes</code>, while <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">isLiveBootstrapMarker</code> only spares a marker whose branch is in this run'\"'\"'s desired set. A prefix-scoped prune therefore deletes a live resume marker for any out-of-scope absent branch. The target is expected to hold other namespaces'\"'\"' refs, so a scoped run can wipe another bootstrap'\"'\"'s ENT-2054 resume state and force a full re-import.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (2)</summary>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/git-sync/blob/ad05d03275134ef902cc921ae098477fea9e6d2e/internal/planner/planner.go#L391-L405\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">internal/planner/