deeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></p>\\n\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>❌ Bugbot Autofix is OFF. To automatically fix reported issues with cloud agents, enable autofix in the <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor dashboard</a>.</sup></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><em>Comment <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">@cursor review</code> or <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">bugbot run</code> to trigger another review on this PR</em></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/git-sync/commit/98ad974a5f6ae1c30d1949d3efc0c0def8209321/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/git-sync/commit/98ad974a5f6ae1c30d1949d3efc0c0def8209321\\\"><tt>98ad974</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/git-sync/pull/121#discussion_r3992635557\",\n        \"body\": \"### Mapped markers escape prune scope\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`InTargetScope` now decides a bootstrap marker'\"'\"'s include scope only via `includedByPrefix` on the checkpointed branch. Explicit `Mappings` still bypass include prefixes in discovery, so a mapped branch outside those prefixes is desired and managed, but its `refs/gitsync/bootstrap/heads/` marker is treated as another writer'\"'\"'s. `hasBootstrapResumeMarker` then misses a live resume marker for that branch, and a later prune can never delete the stale marker.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 7794cc81-a50a-433c-9f63-383993e1d00c -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ninternal/planner/types.go#L164-L166\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 98ad974a5f6ae1c30d1949d3efc0c0def8209321. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3992635557,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 5182616892,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-09-11T19:20:36Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-11T19:20:36Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"internal/planner/types.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Mapped markers escape prune scope</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">InTargetScope</code> now decides a bootstrap marker'\"'\"'s include scope only via <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">includedByPrefix</code> on the checkpointed branch. Explicit <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">Mappings</code> still bypass include prefixes in discovery, so a mapped branch outside those prefixes is desired and managed, but its <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">refs/gitsync/bootstrap/heads/</code> marker is treated as another writer'\"'\"'s. <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">hasBootstrapResumeMarker</code> then misses a live resume marker for that branch, and a later prune can never delete the stale marker.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/ima