ph-113.json' '{\n  \"p\": {\n    \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/pulls/113\",\n    \"id\": 4298091355,\n    \"node_id\": \"PR_kwDOSqVa0c8AAAABAC-rWw\",\n    \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/113\",\n    \"diff_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/113.diff\",\n    \"patch_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/113.patch\",\n    \"issue_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/issues/113\",\n    \"commits_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/pulls/113/commits\",\n    \"review_comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/pulls/113/comments\",\n    \"review_comment_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/pulls/comments{/number}\",\n    \"comments_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/issues/113/comments\",\n    \"statuses_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/entireio/entire-graph/statuses/b4db4f864eae4e3bda9f0e7c549df1f24788bc0e\",\n    \"number\": 113,\n    \"state\": \"closed\",\n    \"locked\": false,\n    \"title\": \"feat: prose retrieval + benchmark kit, README and docs refresh\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"login\": \"ashtom\",\n      \"id\": 70720,\n      \"node_id\": \"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzIw\",\n      \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70720?v=4\",\n      \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom\",\n      \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/ashtom\",\n      \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/followers\",\n      \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/following{/other_user}\",\n      \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/gists{/gist_id}\",\n      \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n      \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/subscriptions\",\n      \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/orgs\",\n      \"repos_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/repos\",\n      \"events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/events{/privacy}\",\n      \"received_events_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/ashtom/received_events\",\n      \"type\": \"User\",\n      \"user_view_type\": \"public\",\n      \"site_admin\": false\n    },\n    \"body\": \"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-graph/trails/73\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Merges #104 (prose retrieval by section, multi-resolution promotion, and the\\n  full LoCoMo benchmark kit) as the foundation this README documents.\\n- Replaces the console-first landing page with a concise agent-first setup and\\n  usage flow, backed by a captured coding-agent walkthrough with visible graph\\n  queries, source grounding, cache signals, and limitations.\\n- Documents installation, agent activation, commands, search behavior, cache\\n  operation, trust boundaries, and snapshot formats.\\n- Reorganizes active documentation under consistent lowercase names; moves\\n  historical material into `docs/archive`.\\n- Adds the LoCoMo benchmark comparison to `docs/benchmarks.md` (root README\\n  stays number-free per this PR'\"'\"'s own `docs/readme-plan.md`), including a\\n  verified BM25 arm — real harness code plus a result confirmed against the\\n  live run log, not asserted.\\n\\n## Why\\n\\nEntire Graph is primarily used through a coding agent, but the previous README\\ndid not explain that journey clearly, and the benchmark evidence for the\\nretrieval work in #104 needed a home. This PR gives new users a complete\\nfirst-use path and a complete, sourced accuracy/cost comparison, in one place.\\n\\n## Relationship to #104\\n\\nThis branch contains #104'\"'\"'s full diff. #104 remains open for its own review\\nhistory; once this PR merges, #104'\"'\"'s commits are already on `main` and it\\nshould be closed as superseded rather than merged separately.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `mise run test`, `go vet`, `gofmt` clean.\\n- Active Markdown links and heading anchors checked (scripted, all resolve).\\n- `git diff --check`.\\n- BM25 result cross-checked against the harness'\"'\"'s own run log: `full_bm25`,\\n  2026-08-15 22:41 UTC, 1415/1540 = 91.88%, `fair_mode: true`.\",\n    \"labels\": [],\n    \"milestone\": null,\n    \"active_lock_reason\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-08-17T18:08:23Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-08-18T21:37:32Z\",\n    \"closed_at\": \"2026-08-18T21:37:32Z\",\n    \"merged_at\": \"2026-08-18T21:37:32Z\",\n    \"merge_commit_sha\": \"212af697863a42a7260ff5bba353db3753d00253\",\n    \"assignee\": null,\n    \"assignees\": [],\n    \"requested_reviewers\": [],\n    \"requested_teams\": [],\n    \"head\": {\n      \"label\": \"entireio:ashtom/readme-refresh\",\n      \"ref\": \"ashtom/readme-refresh\",\n      \"repo\": {\n        \"id\": 1252350673,\n        \"node_id\": \"R_kgDOSqVa0Q\",\n        \"name\": \"entire-graph\",\n        \"full_name\": \"entireio/entire-graph\",\n        \"owner\": {\n          \"login\": \"entireio\",\n          \"id\": 33188652,\n          \"node_id\": \"REDACTED\",\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33188652?v=4\",\n          \"gravatar_id\": \"\",\n          \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio\",\n          \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/entireio\",\n          \"followers_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio/followers\",\n          \"following_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio/following{/other_user}\",\n          \"gists_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio/gists{/gist_id}\",\n          \"starred_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\n          \"subscriptions_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio/subscriptions\",\n          \"organizations_url\": \"https://api.github.com/users/entireio/orgs\",\n          \"repos_url\