epos/entireio/cli/pulls/1146\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"author_association\": \"CONTRIBUTOR\",\n    \"auto_merge\": null,\n    \"draft\": false,\n    \"merged\": false,\n    \"mergeable\": true,\n    \"rebaseable\": false,\n    \"mergeable_state\": \"blocked\",\n    \"merged_by\": null,\n    \"comments\": 5,\n    \"review_comments\": 10,\n    \"maintainer_can_modify\": false,\n    \"commits\": 19,\n    \"additions\": 1724,\n    \"deletions\": 9,\n    \"changed_files\": 19\n  },\n  \"c\": {\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#issuecomment-4401741324\",\n        \"body\": \"bugbot run\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"alishakawaguchi\",\n          \"name\": \"alishakawaguchi\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6415609?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 6415609\n        },\n        \"id\": 4401741324,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:50:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:50:34Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">bugbot run</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205140099\",\n        \"body\": \"### Checkpoint history check ignores v2 format entirely\\n\\n**High Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`repoHasHistory` only queries the v1 checkpoint store via `checkpoint.NewGitStore(repo)`. Users with `checkpoints_version == 2` store all checkpoints under v2 refs, so this function always returns `false` for them — routing to `StageFirstCapture` instead of `StageWorkflow` even when the repo has extensive checkpoint history. The code needs to branch on `settings.CheckpointsVersion(ctx)` and use `NewV2GitStore` for v2 repos, matching the pattern used elsewhere (e.g. `attach.go`).\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 55357138-cf38-4171-96af-a0367d30a990 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour/state.go#L110-L116\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Triggered by learned rule: <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot/rules/learned/9e04ac2e-f264-40ee-8a1e-3b5aa364edf9\\\">Checkpoint logic must handle both v1 and v2 format modes</a></sup>\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205140099,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248206091,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/tour/state.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Checkpoint history check ignores v2 format entirely</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>High Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">repoHasHistory</code> only queries the v1 checkpoint store via <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint.NewGitStore(repo)</code>. Users with <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoints_version == 2</code> store all checkpoints under v2 refs, so this function always returns <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">false</code> for them — routing to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">StageFirstCapture</code> instead of <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">StageWorkflow</code> even when the repo has extensive checkpoint history. The code needs to branch on <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">settings.CheckpointsVersion(ctx)</code> and use <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">NewV2GitStore</code> for v2 repos, matching the pattern used elsewhere (e.g. <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">attach.go</code>).</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Triggered by learned rule: <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot/rules/learned/9e04ac2e-f264-40ee-8a1e-3b5aa364edf9\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Checkpoint logic must handle both v1 and v2 format modes</a></sup></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class='"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":10334}},"started_at_ms":1794842141111,"completed_at_ms":1794842141112}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-16T15:15:41.228Z","ordinal":3097,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1d516-ad7f-7071-81ac-409a5dad90b1","turn_id":"01a1e4cf-42fc-7bf1-b6f5-3fd32ae90631","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-aa4f4abf-bc0a-4ce5-97b2-6635ddf11572","process_id":"61469","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 -c 'import sys;open(sys.argv[1],\"ab\").write(sys.argv[2].encode())' '/Users/puneetpalsingh/.codex/entire-20-audit-2026-11-16/public/cli-1146.json' '\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae\\\"><tt>0817da7</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205140101\",\n        \"body\": \"### Cached settings loader always reports repo as set up\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`cachedTourSettingsLoader` hardcodes the `isSetUp` return value to `true` whenever `loadErr` is nil. But `settings.Load()` succeeds with default settings even when no `.entire/settings.json` exists, so in repos where Entire was never enabled, `ResolveState` skips the `StageSetup` route and falls through to `StageAgentInstall`. Users who haven'\"'\"'t set up Entire see the \\\"install agent hooks\\\" prompt instead of the \\\"get started with Entire\\\" setup prompt.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 53a75f77-400c-4922-bdaf-f261dc90b6eb -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L167-L175\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205140101,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248206091,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 177,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/learn_cmd.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Cached settings loader always reports repo as set up</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">cachedTourSettingsLoader</code> hardcodes the <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">isSetUp</code> return value to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">true</code> whenever <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">loadErr</code> is nil. But <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">settings.Load()</code> succeeds with default settings even when no <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">.entire/settings.json</code> exists, so in repos where Entire was never enabled, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">ResolveState</code> skips the <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">StageSetup</code> route and falls through to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">StageAgentInstall</code>. Users who haven'\"'\"'t set up Entire see the \\\"install agent hooks\\\" prompt instead of the \\\"get started with Entire\\\" setup prompt.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae\\\"><tt>0817da7</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205140108\",\n        \"body\": \"### Configured summary model silently dropped from tour options\\n\\n**Low Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`executeTour` extracts `SummaryGeneration.Provider` from settings but never reads `SummaryGeneration.Model`, leaving `opts.SummarizeModel` as the zero value. Users who configured both a provider and a model hint (e.g., `\\\"model\\\": \\\"sonnet\\\"`) via `entire configure --summarize-provider` will have their model preference silently ignored. The analogous `resolveCheckpointSummaryProvider` in `explain_summary_provider.go` correctly passes `s.SummaryGeneration.Model`.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: a32fda71-6e82-43bd-92c7-0a800bd0572e -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L82-L94\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205140108,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248206091,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 108,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/learn_cmd.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Configured summary model silently dropped from tour options</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Low Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">executeTour</code> extracts <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">SummaryGeneration.Provider</code> from settings but never reads <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">SummaryGeneration.Model</code>, leaving <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">opts.SummarizeModel</code> as the zero value. Users who configured both a provider and a model hint (e.g., <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">\\\"model\\\": \\\"sonnet\\\"</code>) via <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire configure --summarize-provider</code> will have their model preference silently ignored. The analogous <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">resolveCheckpointSummaryProvider</code> in <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">explain_summary_provider.go</code> correctly passes <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">s.SummaryGeneration.Model</code>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae\\\"><tt>0817da7</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#pullrequestreview-4248206091\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4248206091,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205144849\",\n        \"body\": \"translateTourError wraps ErrNotGitRepo in SilentError but does not print tourNotGitRepoMessage anywhere. Since main.go suppresses output for SilentError, this will cause `entire tour` outside a git repo to exit non-zero with no user-facing message. Consider printing the friendly message to an error writer (e.g., plumb cmd.ErrOrStderr()/root.ErrOrStderr() into executeTour/translateTourError) before returning SilentError, or return a non-Silent error so main prints it.\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"Copilot\",\n          \"name\": \"Copilot\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 175728472\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205144849,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248211003,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:56:05Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:56:07Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">translateTourError wraps ErrNot'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/puneetpalsingh/Documents/Code/OSSplayground/Entire/cli","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 -c 'import sys;open(sys.argv[1],\"ab\").write(sys.argv[2].encode())' '/Users/puneetpalsingh/.codex/entire-20-audit-2026-11-16/public/cli-1146.json' '\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae\\\"><tt>0817da7</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205140101\",\n        \"body\": \"### Cached settings loader always reports repo as set up\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`cachedTourSettingsLoader` hardcodes the `isSetUp` return value to `true` whenever `loadErr` is nil. But `settings.Load()` succeeds with default settings even when no `.entire/settings.json` exists, so in repos where Entire was never enabled, `ResolveState` skips the `StageSetup` route and falls through to `StageAgentInstall`. Users who haven'\"'\"'t set up Entire see the \\\"install agent hooks\\\" prompt instead of the \\\"get started with Entire\\\" setup prompt.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 53a75f77-400c-4922-bdaf-f261dc90b6eb -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L167-L175\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205140101,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248206091,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 177,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/learn_cmd.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Cached settings loader always reports repo as set up</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">cachedTourSettingsLoader</code> hardcodes the <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">isSetUp</code> return value to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">true</code> whenever <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">loadErr</code> is nil. But <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">settings.Load()</code> succeeds with default settings even when no <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">.entire/settings.json</code> exists, so in repos where Entire was never enabled, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">ResolveState</code> skips the <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">StageSetup</code> route and falls through to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">StageAgentInstall</code>. Users who haven'\"'\"'t set up Entire see the \\\"install agent hooks\\\" prompt instead of the \\\"get started with Entire\\\" setup prompt.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><sup>Reviewed by <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">Cursor Bugbot</a> for commit <a class=\\\"commit-link\\\" data-hovercard-type=\\\"commit\\\" data-hovercard-url=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae/hovercard\\\" href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/commit/0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae\\\"><tt>0817da7</tt></a>. Configure <a href=\\\"https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">here</a>.</sup></p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205140108\",\n        \"body\": \"### Configured summary model silently dropped from tour options\\n\\n**Low Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`executeTour` extracts `SummaryGeneration.Provider` from settings but never reads `SummaryGeneration.Model`, leaving `opts.SummarizeModel` as the zero value. Users who configured both a provider and a model hint (e.g., `\\\"model\\\": \\\"sonnet\\\"`) via `entire configure --summarize-provider` will have their model preference silently ignored. The analogous `resolveCheckpointSummaryProvider` in `explain_summary_provider.go` correctly passes `s.SummaryGeneration.Model`.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: a32fda71-6e82-43bd-92c7-0a800bd0572e -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L82-L94\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 0817da72d5d434a49e15767f1d7d9a74a119f0ae. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205140108,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248206091,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-07T22:54:34Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 108,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/learn_cmd.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Configured summary model silently dropped from tour options</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Low Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">executeTour</code> extracts <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">SummaryGeneration.Provider</code> from settings but never reads <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">SummaryGeneration.Model</code>, leaving <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">opts.SummarizeModel</code> as the zero value. Users who configured both a provider and a model hint (e.g., <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">\\\"model\\\": \\\"sonnet\\\"</code>) via <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire configure --summarize-provider</code> will have their model preference silently ignored. The analogous <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">resolveCheckpointSummaryProvider</code> in <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">explain_summary_provider.go</code> correctly passes <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">s.SummaryGeneration.Model</code>.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></themed-picture></a> <a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d32f310773b0b80ca3035d8154dc711fc85b63281369057b12943376f7715734/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d98663d2364520c70e7bc21f8c60be71acb1cdae85dd48a2ff2278158e3dbb/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d7765622d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubuser