        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">bugbot run</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3205641285\",\n        \"body\": \"### Agent output unsanitized in `--latest` path\\n\\n**Medium Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\n`GenerateLatest` returns raw agent output without calling `stripControlSequences`, unlike `regenerateFromAgent` which sanitizes its output. When `--latest` and `--regenerate` are both passed, `latestFlag` wins in the `generate` closure but `regenerateFlag` causes the result to be written raw to stdout via `fmt.Fprintln` — bypassing glamour and delivering unsanitized agent output to the persistence path (the mise task pipes stdout to a file). Even without `--regenerate`, the glamour error-fallback path in `executeTour` writes `result.Markdown` directly to the terminal unsanitized.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: c1691e44-1938-4482-aa8b-79b8cb569867 -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour/run.go#L60-L82\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L137-L141\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n\\n- [`cmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L137-L141`](https://github.com/entireio/cli/blob/c8ca02ba09a29551dcebbd134cf2d871ffbbd708/cmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L137-L141)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit c8ca02ba09a29551dcebbd134cf2d871ffbbd708. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 3205641285,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4248752851,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-08T01:18:05Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-08T01:18:05Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/tour/run.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Agent output unsanitized in <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--latest</code> path</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Medium Severity</strong></p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">GenerateLatest</code> returns raw agent output without calling <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">stripControlSequences</code>, unlike <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">regenerateFromAgent</code> which sanitizes its output. When <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--latest</code> and <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--regenerate</code> are both passed, <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">latestFlag</code> wins in the <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">generate</code> closure but <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">regenerateFlag</code> causes the result to be written raw to stdout via <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">fmt.Fprintln</code> — bypassing glamour and delivering unsanitized agent output to the persistence path (the mise task pipes stdout to a file). Even without <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--regenerate</code>, the glamour error-fallback path in <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">executeTour</code> writes <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">result.Markdown</code> directly to the terminal unsanitized.</p>\\n\\n\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://github.com/entireio/cli/blob/c8ca02ba09a29551dcebbd134cf2d871ffbbd708/cmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L137-L141\\\"><code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">cmd/entire/cli/tour_cmd.go#L137-L141</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</details>\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\"><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\"><themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\\\"true\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/8f892a2b1c7e36d49621daf12d83d3200c0ad6842ca1f6d8422631d06c99b3b2/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6c696768742e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/a3745bd9c9e494e3d083228c1efdaf4ec2d519ad1c6adb4160d1c56c1ddeeb7b/68747470733a2f2f637572736f722e636f6d2f6173736574732f696d616765732f6669782d696e2d637572736f722d6461726b2e706e67\\\" data-canonical-src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-i