in\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"cursor[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 206951365\n        },\n        \"id\": 4248752851,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-08T01:18:05Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#issuecomment-4409861505\",\n        \"body\": \"bugbot run\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"alishakawaguchi\",\n          \"name\": \"alishakawaguchi\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6415609?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 6415609\n        },\n        \"id\": 4409861505,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-05-08T21:07:18Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-05-08T21:07:18Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">bugbot run</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1146#discussion_r3211382485\",\n        \"body\": \"### Regenerate always resolves StageSetup in CI, breaking regen\\n\\n**High Severity**\\n\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\\nThe `--regenerate` path calls `ResolveState` which checks whether Entire is enabled in the current repo. In CI (and fresh checkouts), no `.entire/settings.json` exists, so `IsSetUpAny` returns `false` and `ResolveState` returns `StageSetup`. The state is then passed to the agent prompt, which instructs the agent to produce a minimal 4–6 line setup guide instead of the full workflow tour. The mise task validation (≥4 `## ` headers) rejects this output, so CI tour regeneration always fails and every release ships the stub. The `--regenerate` path likely needs to force the state to `StageWorkflow` since the embedded tour is only served to workflow/first-capture users.\\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\\n\\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 3ac22422-79b4-4746-aaeb-6634c26be41b -->\\n\\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour/run.go#L91-L103\\ncmd/entire/cli/tour/state.go#L61-L68\\nLOCATIONS END -->\\n<details>\\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\\n\\n- [`cmd/entire/cli/tour/state.go#L61-L68`](https://github.com/entireio/cli/blob/68a03d980f7559c367a10beb0aff1b744ae5a1fd/cmd/entire/cli/tour/state.go#L61-L68)\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<div><a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Cursor\\\" width=\\\"115\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\\\"><img alt=\\\"Fix in Web\\\" width=\\\"99\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" src=\\\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\\\"></picture></a></div>\\n\\n\\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 68a03d980f7559c367a10beb0aff1b744ae5a1fd. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n   