{"timestamp":"2026-11-16T15:15:41.906Z","ordinal":3102,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1d516-ad7f-7071-81ac-409a5dad90b1","turn_id":"01a1e4cf-42fc-7bf1-b6f5-3fd32ae90631","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-497da402-abd4-48d1-842a-dc9fc4572ab3","process_id":"29744","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 -c 'import sys;open(sys.argv[1],\"ab\").write(sys.argv[2].encode())' '/Users/puneetpalsingh/.codex/entire-20-audit-2026-11-16/public/cli-1768.json' '{\n  \"c\": {\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1768#discussion_r3590416123\",\n        \"body\": \"The helper comment claims the seeded checkpoint makes both the condensed branch view and the pending rewind-point view return an entry, but the routing test above explicitly asserts the pending dataset remains empty (because GetRewindPoints requires active-session state). This comment is misleading and should describe only the condensed dataset seeding.\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"Copilot\",\n          \"name\": \"Copilot\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 175728472\n        },\n        \"id\": 3590416123,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4707746278,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-15T20:07:35Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-15T20:07:35Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list_test.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">The helper comment claims the seeded checkpoint makes both the condensed branch view and the pending rewind-point view return an entry, but the routing test above explicitly asserts the pending dataset remains empty (because GetRewindPoints requires active-session state). This comment is misleading and should describe only the condensed dataset seeding.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1768#discussion_r3590416155\",\n        \"body\": \"This comment says a \\\"truncated\\\" session prompt is appended, but the implementation only sanitizes the prompt (via sanitizeForTerminal) and does not truncate it. Either truncate the prompt here or adjust the comment to match the actual behavior.\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"Copilot\",\n          \"name\": \"Copilot\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 175728472\n        },\n        \"id\": 3590416155,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": 4707746278,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-15T20:07:35Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-15T20:07:35Z\",\n        \"review\": null,\n        \"side\": \"RIGHT\",\n        \"line\": 120,\n        \"start_line\": 116,\n        \"path\": \"cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list.go\",\n        \"body_html\": \"<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">This comment says a \\\"truncated\\\" session prompt is appended, but the implementation only sanitizes the prompt (via sanitizeForTerminal) and does not truncate it. Either truncate the prompt here or adjust the comment to match the actual behavior.</p>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1768#pullrequestreview-4707746278\",\n        \"body\": \"## Pull request overview\\n\\nThis PR adds a stable, machine-readable checkpoint listing to the non-deprecated `entire checkpoint list` command by introducing `--json` (condensed checkpoints as JSON) and `--pending` (live shadow-branch rewind points), and migrates internal/docs/harness consumers off the deprecated `rewind --list` surface.\\n\\n**Changes:**\\n- Added `entire checkpoint list --json` for condensed branch checkpoints (JSON).\\n- Added `entire checkpoint list --pending [--json]`, where `--pending --json` is a drop-in replacement for the removed `rewind --list` JSON contract.\\n- Removed `--list` from the deprecated `rewind` command and centralized rewind-point label rendering for reuse.\\n\\n### Reviewed changes\\n\\nCopilot reviewed 12 out of 12 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\\n\\n| File | Description |\\r\\n| ---- | ----------- |\\r\\n| WINDOWS.md | Updates Windows verification steps to use the new pending JSON listing. |\\r\\n| scripts/test-attribution-e2e.sh | Migrates script usage from `rewind --list` to `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| e2e/entire/entire.go | Updates E2E harness JSON parser to call `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/testutil/testutil.go | Updates testutil docs/types to reference the new pending JSON listing contract. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/rewind.go | Removes the deprecated `--list` implementation and reuses shared label logic. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/testenv.go | Repoints `GetRewindPoints()` helper to `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/setup_cmd_test.go | Updates disabled-behavior test to use `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list.go | Implements pending rewind-point JSON + human output and shared label helpers. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list_test.go | Adds tests pinning the drop-in JSON contract and command routing behavior. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_group.go | Extends `checkpoint list` with `--json` and `--pending` routing/validation. |\\r\\n| .claude/skills/test-repo/test-harness.sh | Migrates harness command from `rewind --list` to new pending JSON listing. |\\r\\n| .claude/skills/test-repo/SKILL.md | Updates skill documentation examples to use `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 175728472\n        },\n        \"id\": 4707746278,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-15T20:07:35Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"<h2 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Pull request overview</h2>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">This PR adds a stable, machine-readable checkpoint listing to the non-deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire checkpoint list</code> command by introducing <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--json</code> (condensed checkpoints as JSON) and <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--pending</code> (live shadow-branch rewind points), and migrates internal/docs/harness consumers off the deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind --list</code> surface.</p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li>Added <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire checkpoint list --json</code> for condensed branch checkpoints (JSON).</li>\\n<li>Added <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire checkpoint list --pending [--json]</code>, where <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--pending --json</code> is a drop-in replacement for the removed <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind --list</code> JSON contract.</li>\\n<li>Removed <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--list</code> from the deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind</code> command and centralized rewind-point label rendering for reuse.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Reviewed changes</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Copilot reviewed 12 out of 12 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.</p>\\n<details>\\n<summary>Show a summary per 