ll `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/testutil/testutil.go | Updates testutil docs/types to reference the new pending JSON listing contract. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/rewind.go | Removes the deprecated `--list` implementation and reuses shared label logic. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/testenv.go | Repoints `GetRewindPoints()` helper to `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/setup_cmd_test.go | Updates disabled-behavior test to use `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list.go | Implements pending rewind-point JSON + human output and shared label helpers. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list_test.go | Adds tests pinning the drop-in JSON contract and command routing behavior. |\\r\\n| cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_group.go | Extends `checkpoint list` with `--json` and `--pending` routing/validation. |\\r\\n| .claude/skills/test-repo/test-harness.sh | Migrates harness command from `rewind --list` to new pending JSON listing. |\\r\\n| .claude/skills/test-repo/SKILL.md | Updates skill documentation examples to use `checkpoint list --pending --json`. |\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]\",\n          \"name\": \"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4\",\n          \"id\": 175728472\n        },\n        \"id\": 4707746278,\n        \"pull_request_review_id\": null,\n        \"in_reply_to_id\": null,\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-07-15T20:07:35Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": null,\n        \"review\": \"COMMENTED\",\n        \"side\": null,\n        \"line\": null,\n        \"start_line\": null,\n        \"path\": null,\n        \"body_html\": \"<h2 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Pull request overview</h2>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">This PR adds a stable, machine-readable checkpoint listing to the non-deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire checkpoint list</code> command by introducing <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--json</code> (condensed checkpoints as JSON) and <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--pending</code> (live shadow-branch rewind points), and migrates internal/docs/harness consumers off the deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind --list</code> surface.</p>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\\n<ul dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<li>Added <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire checkpoint list --json</code> for condensed branch checkpoints (JSON).</li>\\n<li>Added <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">entire checkpoint list --pending [--json]</code>, where <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--pending --json</code> is a drop-in replacement for the removed <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind --list</code> JSON contract.</li>\\n<li>Removed <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--list</code> from the deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind</code> command and centralized rewind-point label rendering for reuse.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3 dir=\\\"auto\\\">Reviewed changes</h3>\\n<p dir=\\\"auto\\\">Copilot reviewed 12 out of 12 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.</p>\\n<details>\\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\\\"table\\\">\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>File</th>\\n<th>Description</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>WINDOWS.md</td>\\n<td>Updates Windows verification steps to use the new pending JSON listing.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>scripts/test-attribution-e2e.sh</td>\\n<td>Migrates script usage from <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind --list</code> to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint list --pending --json</code>.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>e2e/entire/entire.go</td>\\n<td>Updates E2E harness JSON parser to call <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint list --pending --json</code>.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/testutil/testutil.go</td>\\n<td>Updates testutil docs/types to reference the new pending JSON listing contract.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/rewind.go</td>\\n<td>Removes the deprecated <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--list</code> implementation and reuses shared label logic.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/testenv.go</td>\\n<td>Repoints <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">GetRewindPoints()</code> helper to <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint list --pending --json</code>.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/setup_cmd_test.go</td>\\n<td>Updates disabled-behavior test to use <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint list --pending --json</code>.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list.go</td>\\n<td>Implements pending rewind-point JSON + human output and shared label helpers.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_list_test.go</td>\\n<td>Adds tests pinning the drop-in JSON contract and command routing behavior.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint_group.go</td>\\n<td>Extends <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint list</code> with <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--json</code> and <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">--pending</code> routing/validation.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>.claude/skills/test-repo/test-harness.sh</td>\\n<td>Migrates harness command from <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">rewind --list</code> to new pending JSON listing.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>.claude/skills/test-repo/SKILL.md</td>\\n<td>Updates skill documentation examples to use <code class=\\\"notranslate\\\">checkpoint list --pending --json</code>.</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\\n</details>\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1768#pullrequestreview-4708600791\",\n        \"body\": \"\",\n        \"user\": {\n          \"login\": \"peyton-alt\",\n          \"name\": \"peyton-alt\",\n          \"email\": null,\n          \"avatar_url\": \"https